+      has:
+        kind: delegation_specifier
+        regex: ^MutableLiveData<
+    - kind: class_declaration
+      has:
+        kind: type_identifier
+        regex: ^(Single)?LiveEvent$
+    - pattern: $E.getContentIfNotHandled()
+    - pattern: $E?.getContentIfNotHandled()
+---
+id: kt-vm-fun-returns-stream
+language: kotlin
+severity: warning
+message: '[STATE-3]ViewModel 公開函式每呼叫一次就回傳新的 LiveData/Flow,重建後又重打資料層;改成輸入放 MutableStateFlow,輸出用 flatMapLatest/switchMap 推導成屬性'
